{"id":"gefu_hrt","lemma":"geführt","pos":"adj","rank":1684,"glosses":["guided, conducted","managed, administered"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/97/De-at-gef%C3%BChrt.ogg/De-at-gef%C3%BChrt.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Es hat zu nichts geführt.","en":"It came to nothing.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"nothing"},null]},{"text":"Sie hat ihn in Versuchung geführt.","en":"She tempted him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/70521","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"him"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"temptation"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe früher ein Tagebuch geführt.","en":"I used to keep a diary.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755520","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"formerly, in the past"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"diary, journal"},null]},{"text":"Ich wurde an meinen Platz geführt.","en":"I was ushered to my seat.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"to opine, to think"},{"g":"square, plaza, piazza"},null]},{"text":"Sie hat mich zum Palast geführt.","en":"She guided me to the palace.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"palace"},null]}]}